  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760368,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Dive into a double dose of Pixar adventure with *2 Games in 1 - Alla Ricerca di Nemo + Gli Incredibili - Una 'Normale' Famiglia di Supereroi* for the Game Boy Advance! This unique cartridge combines two beloved stories into one exciting package.\n\nFirst, embark on *Alla Ricerca di Nemo* (Finding Nemo), guiding Marlin on his perilous journey to find his lost son. Navigate vibrant coral reefs, evade hungry sharks, and encounter unforgettable characters like Dory and the Tank Gang. Gameplay involves simple, intuitive controls as you maneuver Marlin through challenging underwater environments, solving puzzles and avoiding obstacles.\n\nThen, switch gears to *Gli Incredibili* (The Incredibles), where you’ll experience the adventures of Mr. Incredible, Elastigirl, Violet, Dash, and Jack-Jack as they balance family life with superhero duties.  Battle villains, use each family member’s unique powers, and uncover a sinister plot threatening Metroville.  *Gli Incredibili* offers a more action-oriented experience with platforming and combat elements. \n\nExperience the magic of Pixar, twice!"
    },
